~ IcreamTalk
Jacob: Good afternoon, my name is Detective (Name) and I’m looking for Iggy. I was told he was here a lot, do you know him?
Jacob: Ahh Iggy, of course i know him, he and his friends come almost everyday, he isnt in trouble is he? 
Jacob: Hopefully not, but he’s been missing for a week. Have you seen anything? 
Icy Giovanni: Now that you mention it, he wasn´t here for quiet some time now, his Friends werent here the last two days too, I do hope that meet-up worked out okay...
Jacob: Meet-up?  
Icy Giovanni: Yeah, his friends were talking about meeting him... said something like... a cabin that belonged to one of their grandparents or something? But they did mention the woods.
Jacob: So they wanted to meet Iggy a week ago in that shack?... you wouldn’t happen to know where exactly it is, would you?
Icy Giovanni: Oh, should not be far from here, the kids hang out there all the time, there’s this small trail off the road by the woods just before you’d drive out of the city, just follow down there, you can’t miss it. 
Jacob: That was very helpful, thank you very much for your help.
Icy Giovanni: Ah dont mention it, it was nothing really...I hope they’re okay...

